<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7969" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρό-γῠνος</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>man-woman, hermaphrodite,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				189e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>womanish man, effeminate person,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				1.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.127
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.219f
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Pr.</u>
				18.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρογύνων ἄθυρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					3D.
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			=
			<i>pathicus, cinaedus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				6.254
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Myrin.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				12.42
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> of women,
				<i>Sapphic,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔρωτες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					28
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				2.12
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
